stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /videos
  body: { title, description }
  → 201 { videoId, uploadUrl, sessionToken }

POST /videos/:videoId/chunks
  body: binary chunk with range header
  → 200 { nextChunkOffset }

GET /videos/:videoId/status
  → 200 { videoId, status, renditions: [ { resolution, codec, url } ] }

GET /videos/:videoId/manifest
  → 200 { m3u8 or mpd }

GET /videos/:videoId/renditions/:resolution
  → 302 redirect to CDN URL or stream

GET /search?q=...
  → 200 { videos: [ { id, title, thumbnail } ] }
